&lt;p&gt;An incomplete list (write me if any resource is missing):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(official) https://nixos.org/learn/&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(official) https://nixos.org/guides/nix-pills/&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(inofficial) &lt;a href="https://github.com/ryan4yin/nixos-and-flakes-book"&gt;NixOS &amp;amp; Flakes Book&lt;/a&gt; © 2023 by Ryan Yin &lt;/li&gt;
