&lt;li&gt;(inofficial?) https://github.com/spacekookie/learning-nix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this reason, I decided to go ahead and start my own learning process :)
If you want to learn more, see the &lt;a href="https://kiqo.github.io/pages/overview-nix-pages"&gt;Nix Overview&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><category>nix</category><category>os</category><guid>https://kiqo.github.io/posts/post-how-to-learn-nix/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 13 Oct 2024 10:52:28 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>